xt{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3},{x}_{4}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4} \\\\ 2{x}_{4} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74984/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e66c269-233b-57f8-9dae-46eb78c228bc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74984"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186120315 :question/answer-fields 17592186118365] {:db/id "q-35460/selection/ma-v1/de8c4fe72ce753bc87a1c1cca1fd8b636e986e9328ecf7d1edaa78a8a5df32aa/aa5c2d0bc78a2194776464f5a45e4844749def5b12e608e52212396450f82473" :answer/id #uuid "5d489094-ec8a-514e-ab08-0bf6383919be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35460/selection/ma-v1/de8c4fe72ce753bc87a1c1cca1fd8b636e986e9328ecf7d1edaa78a8a5df32aa/e8d54b5d6726e90fb07fba1edfd4f2aed4a66380ec04cbcbfc60664685c862bb" :answer/id #uuid "b0615c10-422a-5d43-b2f2-eada31ad1404" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35460/selection/ma-v1/