sis of $\\text{Null}(A),$ we need to solve the equation $Ax=0$ and express the solution as a linear combination of linearly independent vectors. Those vectors form a basis of $\\text{Null}(A).$\n\nSince $A∼B,$ the equation $Ax=0$ is equivalent to the equation $Bx=0,$ which corresponds to the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-3{x}_{4}=0 \\\\ {x}_{2}-{x}_{4}=0 \\\\ {x}_{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the general solution is ${x}_{1}=3{x}_{4}$ and ${x}_{2}={x}_{4},$  and ${x}_{3}=0,$ where  ${x}_{4}$ is a free variable. Therefore, if $x\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{4} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,{x}_{4}\\in R.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis implies that \n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nis a basis of $\\text{Null}(A)$ since it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-111507/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6cba14b5-62f7-5fbe-beb1-9b1511305cc6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-111507"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-111478/selection/79273027d5010743aaea41438f6711a071eadb317dd07a84640da1f8df74d3cc" :answer/id #uuid "4d179485-b910-5337-adb1-7cfe2bc346ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111478/selection/df902b193d67286707b4bae7920c63828edbf621e6e4071b0ee16b5aad764cc5" :answer/id #uuid "24050a22-0148-5ddf-b675-33dde2d953bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111478/se